    <string name="howto_title">HOW TO PLAY</string>
    <string name="howto_rotate_title">ROTATE</string>
    <string name="howto_rotate_body">Tap a pipe tile to turn it a quarter turn. Every turn costs one move and lifts the line pressure. Nozzles, tanks and boiler blocks never turn.</string>
    <string name="howto_plan_title">PLAN</string>
    <string name="howto_plan_body">The banner lists how many units of each syrup the batch needs. Press GO to send syrup down the pipes; one clean run fills one unit per tank.</string>
    <string name="howto_pressure_title">PRESSURE</string>
    <string name="howto_pressure_body">Turns and wasted pours push the needle up. VENT drops it by five for two moves. At the top of the dial the line bursts.</string>
    <string name="howto_contamination_title">CONTAMINATION</string>
    <string name="howto_contamination_body">Syrup that reaches a tank of another flavour spoils the whole batch. Use DRY RUN to ghost the path before you commit.</string>
    <string name="howto_legend">FLAVOURS</string>
    <string name="howto_disclaimer">18+ VISUAL STYLE ONLY · NO BETS · NO PRIZES · NO PURCHASES</string>

